<title>EU:  EP INSTITUTIONAL AFFAIRS COMMITTEE AGENDA - MAY 13.</title>
<headline>EP INSTITUTIONAL AFFAIRS COMMITTEE AGENDA - MAY 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>Committee on Institutional Affairs</p>
<p>[[ Tuesday 13 May 1997 ]]</p>
<p>EXTRAORDINARY MEETING</p>
<p>0.1</p>
<p>1. Adoption of draft agenda (PE222.236 )</p>
<p>2. Chairman's announcements</p>
<p>===] In the presence of the Council and Commission</p>
<p>3. Preparation of motion for a resolution on the draft treaty, in the presence of Mrs Guigou and Mr Brok</p>
<p>- Exchange of views - Adoption of oral question Possibly, adoption of oral question to the Commission</p>
<p>4. Exchange of views with Mrs Cederschiold (IGC monitor) on the third pillar (PE219.958+ANN )</p>
<p>5. Any other business</p>
<p>6. Date of next meeting (in Brussels) (PE/XVI/OJ/97-12 )</p>
<p>6.1</p>
<p>6.2 o o o END OF DOCUMENT.</p>
</text>
